      <li><strong>Re-Generation Inefficiency:</strong> Typing <code>--ar 16:9</code> in Midjourney burns valuable GPU fast hours and alters the prompt seed, often generating a completely different image rather than reframing your favorite generation.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      RemoveSynth's <strong>AI Image Resizer</strong> solves this framing dilemma through intelligent canvas expansion. Instead of slicing your artwork, the engine centers your original generation at 100 percent native resolution and synthetically generates an ambient, color-harmonized smart blur background to fill the extended aspect ratio perfectly.
    </p>

